# Build output. Regenerate with `python3 -I build.py` (dist/) and
# `python3 -I preview.py` (preview/). Not committed, for the same reason
# second-growth-site does not commit site/: a generated tree turns every
# rebuild into a 340-file diff and the commit stops being readable.
dist/
preview/

# Transient fetch artefact. fetch_prices.py drops the USDA report here while
# parsing it; the durable copies live in data-engineering/raw/usda_terminal/,
# keyed by report date, because the series cannot be refetched.
src/*.pdf

__pycache__/
*.pyc
